                    the President’s Files (Winston
                    Lord)—China Trip/Vietnam, Sensitive Camp David, Vol. XXIV. Secret;
                    Operational Immediate; Sensitive; Exclusively Eyes Only. Sent via Guay and Scowcroft.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d283-f2" n="2" xml:id="d283-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Scowcroft became Military Assistant to
                    the President on February 12.</p>
            </note>
